{"type":"message","id":"c09efaca","parentId":"e3bff862","timestamp":"2026-05-21T06:03:17.776Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-05-21 06:03 UTC] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: First, run: cat /tmp/research.json — to load your research data. Then read COINOGRAPHY_TEMPLATE.md in your workspace. Write a 1100-1200 word crypto news article. Finish completely with the Sources and Word Count block. Write the full final article directly to the file /tmp/crypto-article-raw.md using your file writing tools. Do NOT return the article text in your chat response. Yield back ONLY the word \"SUCCESS\"."}],"timestamp":1779343397766}}
